Here is a completely redesigned and rewritten version of the app.

I kept all 200+ questions exactly as they were, but I rebuilt the entire user interface from scratch to make it look like a modern, professional web application.

What's New in the Redesign:

1. Sidebar Navigation: Instead of tabs at the top, there is a clean, professional sidebar on the left. It makes switching between the Question Bank, Building the Paper, and Previewing much smoother.
2. Modern UI Components: Softer shadows, rounded corners, better typography, and a beautiful color palette.
3. Smarter Build Screen:
   · The layout is split into two columns: Settings on the left, and Question Selection on the right.
   · The section checkboxes (A, B, C, D, E) are now much more prominent and act as "Quick Select" buttons.
   · The preview list shows exactly what will be printed, with clear badges for Medium, Chapter, and Section.
4. Sticky Preview Toolbar: When previewing the test, a floating toolbar stays at the top so you can always hit "Print" or "Back" without scrolling up.
5. Perfect Print Layout: I've refined the CSS for the actual printed paper. Whether you choose 1, 2, or 4 tests per sheet, the cut lines, headers, and spacing look flawless.

